<title>USA: Bexar Cty, Texas, Hlth deal repriced, ylds raised.</title>
<headline>Bexar Cty, Texas, Hlth deal repriced, ylds raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Bexar County Health Facilities $134 million bond deal, raising yields in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
