<p>RE: $134,700,728.20*</p>
<p>DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION</p>
<p>HEALTH SYSTEM REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>(Baptist Health System Project)</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>WE WILL CONTINUE TO TAKE ORDERS UNTIL 12:00PM EDST ON THE TERM BONDS.</p>
